{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Aken</b> — you are not only like ordinary man, [that] you die. The meaning: for your soul is like the soul of the angels, and behold you are not [subject to death] except that [your] bodies die." "<b>And like one of the officers</b> — who overpower and commit violence, and thus is the way of officers and all judges of earth."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 82, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:50.178232235Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}